            "body": "does it work if you use \"!\" ?\n\n    :restart!\n\nnot sure it makes sense to restore `-d` if we're also restoring the session. we probably need to decide a simple rule:\n\n- when restoring the session, discard all file-opening args: `-d`, `-p`, etc.\n- i'm actually not sure it ever makes sense to restore file-opening args, because you can use a session instead?\n\ncc @nathanzeng ",
