        {
            "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
            "body": "Still need to resolve what to do about the diff window  (`diff`, `scrollbind`, etc.) though. AFAICT sessions don't restore those window local options, so I don't think we want to restore the window without diff-mode, since it looks broken.\n\nA simple solution for `:restart` in diff mode could be:\n```lua\nif vim.o.diff then\n  error('Unable to restart in diff mode. Exit diff mode or use :restart!')\nend\n```\nOtherwise, we could discard the session and just do `:restart!` like I mentioned in a previous comment.\n",
            "created_at": "2026-07-04T19:07:14Z",
            "html_url": "https://github.com/neovim/neovim/issues/40551#issuecomment-4883506524",
            "id": 4883506524,
            "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/neovim/neovim/issues/40551",
