        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "> AFAICT sessions don't restore those window local options,\n\nsee `:help 'sessionoptions'`. `localoptions` is not included by default. probably because of \"reasons\". \n\nthat's why i wanted to wait on [redesigning sessions](https://github.com/neovim/neovim/issues/34204): ye olde Vim sessions are not very reliable.\n\nhowever, it's good that we went ahead and did it anyway, because the basic behavior feels good. but getting everything perfect may be difficult until sessions are perfect :)\n\na possible solution for now is to just document this (i.e. \"if you want window-local options and stuff, then set 'sessionoptions', but beware\").",
            "created_at": "2026-07-04T20:03:29Z",
