        {
            "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
            "body": "I opened #40583 for the documentation fix. \n>When restoring a session, I think neither -d nor -p (and any other \"file\" CLI args) make sense.\n>\nThis seems important to track, maybe in another issue or maybe #40521 can cover that since it's kinda similar.",
